post.description:
Query for Annotations using filters, sorting, and pagination.

Example searches:
- Annotations in a task: {"task_id": {"eq": "..."}}
- Annotations in a project: {"project_id": {"eq": "..."}}
- By annotator: {"annotator_id": {"eq": "<user_id>"}}
- Annotations in multiple tasks: {"task_id": {"inc": ["id1", "id2"]}}

Query for Tasks using filters, sorting, and pagination.

Example searches:
- Tasks in a project: {"project_id": {"eq": "..."}}
- My assigned tasks: {"annotator_id": {"eq": "<user_id>"}}
- Tasks to review: {"reviewer_id": {"eq": "<user_id>"}, "status": {"eq": "to_be_reviewed"}}
- Overdue tasks: {"end_time": {"lt": "2026-02-06T00:00:00Z"}, "status": {"neq": "reviewed"}}
- Tasks in multiple projects: {"project_id": {"inc": ["id1", "id2"]}}
- Range queries: {"creation_time": {"gte": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "lt": "2026-02-01T00:00:00Z"}}
- Tasks with at least one annotation having a specific metadata label:
   {"annotation_metadata": {"metadata_field_id": "<metadata-field-uuid>", "label_id": {"eq": "<label-uuid>"}}}
